---
// Proyek komersial dan sistem produksi nyata Dimaz Devriza
---

<section id="projects" class="py-24 sm:py-32 relative">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    
    <!-- Section Header (Clean Authoritative Title R-09 / R-05) -->
    <div class="mb-16 reveal-on-scroll opacity-0 translate-y-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
        <span class="w-8 h-[2px] bg-sky-400" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-semibold text-sky-400">Portofolio Produksi</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white light:text-slate-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        Proyek Klien & Sistem Produksi
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-300 light:text-slate-700 text-base sm:text-lg max-w-2xl leading-relaxed font-normal">
        Aplikasi web komersial skala produksi yang dibangun secara profesional untuk klien dan institusi. Menangani operasional bisnis nyata dengan fokus pada integritas data, penanganan konkurensi, dan keandalan deployment.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-16">

      <!-- PROYEK 1: D'ROYAL VILLAGE LOGISTIK -->
      <div class="bezel-outer project-card reveal-on-scroll opacity-0 translate-y-8">
        <article class="bezel-inner p-6 sm:p-10">
          
          <!-- Header Bar -->
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-8 pb-6 border-b border-white/[0.06] light:border-slate-200">
            <div>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5 mb-3">
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-semibold bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-300 light:text-amber-700 border border-amber-500/20">
                  Proyek Klien Komersial
                </span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 light:text-slate-600 bg-white/[0.03] light:bg-slate-100 border border-white/[0.06] light:border-slate-200">
                  Kota Padang, Indonesia
                </span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 light:text-slate-600 bg-white/[0.03] light:bg-slate-100 border border-white/[0.06] light:border-slate-200">
                  Januari 2026 - Oktober 2026
                </span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white light:text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
                D'Royal Village: Sistem Logistik & Pengendalian Biaya Proyek
              </h3>
            </div>
            
            <div>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 light:text-emerald-700 text-xs font-semibold border border-emerald-500/20 shadow-sm">
                <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
                  <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-emerald-400"></span>
                </span>
                Aktif Beroperasi di Lapangan
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="text-slate-300 light:text-slate-700 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
            Merancang, membangun, dan men-deploy Sistem Informasi Logistik dan Pengendalian Biaya Proyek berbasis web untuk developer perumahan D'Royal Village. Menggantikan proses manual dan spreadsheet Excel dengan sistem multi-gudang dan multi-cluster terpadu yang memonitor realisasi fisik unit rumah secara real-time.
          </p>

          <!-- Interactive macOS Window Frame: ACID Concurrency Flow with Interactive Tabs (No heavy blur R-10) -->
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.1] light:border-slate-300 bg-slate-950/95 light:bg-slate-50 overflow-hidden mb-10 shadow-xl">
            
            <!-- Window Title Bar & Interactive Tab Switcher -->
            <div class="px-4 py-3 bg-white/[0.02] light:bg-slate-200/50 border-b border-white/[0.08] light:border-slate-200 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate-400 light:text-slate-600">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <div class="flex gap-2" aria-hidden="true">
                  <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-rose-500/80 inline-block"></span>
                  <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-amber-500/80 inline-block"></span>
                  <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80 inline-block"></span>
                </div>
                <span class="ml-3 font-semibold text-slate-200 light:text-slate-800">Arsitektur Produksi: Transaksi & Database</span>
              </div>

              <!-- Interactive Tabs -->
              <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-black/40 light:bg-slate-200 p-1 rounded-xl border border-white/[0.06] light:border-slate-300">
                <button
                  type="button"
                  data-tab="flow"
                  class="arch-tab-btn active px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold bg-white/[0.1] light:bg-white text-white light:text-slate-900 transition-all duration-200"
                >
                  Alur Transaksi ACID
                </button>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  data-tab="concurrency"
                  class="arch-tab-btn px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 light:text-slate-600 hover:text-white light:hover:text-slate-900 hover:bg-white/[0.05] transition-all duration-200"
                >
                  Solusi Konkurensi
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Tab Content 1: 4-Step Transaction Flow -->
            <div id="tab-content-flow" class="arch-tab-content p-6 overflow-x-auto">
              <div class="min-w-[640px] grid grid-cols-4 gap-4">
                
                <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.02] light:bg-white border border-white/[0.06] light:border-slate-200 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-sky-400/40 transition-colors group cursor-default">
                  <div>
                    <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-sky-400 mb-1 block">Langkah 01</span>
                    <span class="font-bold text-white light:text-slate-900 text-sm block mb-1">Permintaan Stok</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 light:text-slate-600 leading-snug">Pengawas alokasikan batch material ke nomor unit rumah</span>
                </div>

                <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-sky-500/[0.08] light:bg-sky-50 border border-sky-400/40 light:border-sky-300 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm group cursor-default">
                  <div>
                    <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-sky-300 light:text-sky-700 mb-1 block">Langkah 02: Kunci Baris</span>
                    <code class="font-mono text-sky-200 light:text-sky-800 font-bold text-xs block mb-1">lockForUpdate()</code>
                  </div>
                  <span class="text-xs text-slate-300 light:text-slate-600 leading-snug">Pessimistic row lock di MySQL saat transaksi dimulai</span>
                </div>

                <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.02] light:bg-white border border-white/[0.06] light:border-slate-200 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-sky-400/40 transition-colors group cursor-default">
                  <div>
                    <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-sky-400 mb-1 block">Langkah 03</span>
                    <span class="font-bold text-white light:text-slate-900 text-sm block mb-1">Validasi Kuantitas</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 light:text-slate-600 leading-snug">Pemeriksaan stok fisik aman dan belum habis dialokasikan</span>
                </div>

                <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/[0.08] light:bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-400/40 light:border-emerald-300 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm group cursor-default">
                  <div>
                    <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-emerald-300 light:text-emerald-700 mb-1 block">Langkah 04</span>
                    <span class="font-bold text-emerald-200 light:text-emerald-800 text-sm block mb-1">Commit Transaksi</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="text-xs text-slate-300 light:text-slate-600 leading-snug">Biaya dibukukan ke RAB unit & mutasi tersimpan permanen</span>
                </div>

              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Tab Content 2: Concurrency Comparison -->
            <div id="tab-content-concurrency" class="arch-tab-content hidden p-6">
              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-rose-500/10 light:bg-rose-50 border border-rose-500/25 light:border-rose-200">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2 text-rose-300 light:text-rose-700 font-bold text-xs">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg>
                    <span>Tanpa Pessimistic Locking (Race Condition)</span>
                  </div>
                  <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 light:text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
                    Dua pengawas gudang membuka material batch yang sama dengan sisa 10 zak semen. Mandor A mengajukan 8 zak, Mandor B mengajukan 7 zak secara bersamaan. Keduanya lolos validasi karena membaca stok awal yang sama, mengakibatkan <strong>stok minus (-5 zak)</strong> dan kerugian finansial.
                  </p>
                  <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-rose-400 light:text-rose-700">Hasil: Kegagalan Integritas Inventaris</span>
                </div>

                <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 light:bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-500/25 light:border-emerald-200">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2 text-emerald-300 light:text-emerald-700 font-bold text-xs">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                    <span>Dengan lockForUpdate() & Transaksi DB Dimaz</span>
                  </div>
                  <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 light:text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
                    Saat Mandor A memulai alokasi, baris batch dikunci seketika oleh database. Permintaan Mandor B mengantre hingga transaksi Mandor A selesai di-commit. Mandor B kemudian membaca sisa stok baru (2 zak) dan sistem dengan aman menolak permintaan 7 zak.
                  </p>
                  <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-emerald-400 light:text-emerald-700">Hasil: Zero Stok Minus & 100% Data Konsisten</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>

          <!-- Technical Highlights Grid -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 mb-8">
            
            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] light:bg-slate-50 border border-white/[0.06] light:border-slate-200 hover:border-white/[0.12] transition-colors">
              <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-sky-500/10 border border-sky-400/20 flex items-center justify-center text-sky-400 mb-3.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white light:text-slate-900 mb-2">
                Integritas Database Transaksi ACID
              </h4>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 light:text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                Menjamin tidak ada mutasi stok gantung atau stok minus ketika multi-mandor mengajukan material secara serentak, didukung mekanisme rollback otomatis jika terjadi kegagalan sistem.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] light:bg-slate-50 border border-white/[0.06] light:border-slate-200 hover:border-white/[0.12] transition-colors">
              <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-400/20 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400 mb-3.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 7h6m0 10v-3m-3 3h.01M9 17h.01M9 14h.01M12 14h.01M15 11h.01M12 11h.01M9 11h.01M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white light:text-slate-900 mb-2">
                Inventaris Batch Harga & Beban Unit
              </h4>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 light:text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                Valuasi material dihitung per batch harga pembelian secara presisi (tanpa dirata-rata). Biaya pemakaian dibebankan langsung ke unit rumah sehingga selisih anggaran RAB terpantau akurat.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] light:bg-slate-50 border border-white/[0.06] light:border-slate-200 hover:border-white/[0.12] transition-colors">
              <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-400/20 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-400 mb-3.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white light:text-slate-900 mb-2">
                Pertanggungjawaban Alat & Biaya Cluster
              </h4>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 light:text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                Alur penyelesaian unit rumah mewajibkan verifikasi status fisik alat (baik, rusak, hilang). Biaya sewa alat berat dan fasilitas bersama (drainase, listrik) dicatat terpisah pada beban cluster.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] light:bg-slate-50 border border-white/[0.06] light:border-slate-200 hover:border-white/[0.12] transition-colors">
              <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-400/20 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-400 mb-3.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white light:text-slate-900 mb-2">
                Otorisasi Multi-Peran (RBAC) & Migrasi Excel
              </h4>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 light:text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                Pemisahan wewenang antara Logistik, Pengawas (Mandor), dan Manajemen Keuangan. Dilengkapi modul importir Excel khusus untuk migrasi saldo awal data historis perusahaan.
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>

          <!-- Technologies (R-11: rounded-md for technical tags) -->
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 pt-5 border-t border-white/[0.06] light:border-slate-200">
            <span class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 light:text-slate-600 mr-2">Teknologi Utama:</span>
            {["Laravel 11", "Livewire 3", "Alpine.js", "Tailwind CSS", "MySQL", "Git", "Pessimistic Locking", "Spatie Permission"].map((tech) => (
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium bg-white/[0.04] light:bg-slate-100 text-slate-300 light:text-slate-700 border border-white/[0.08] light:border-slate-300">
                {tech}
              </span>
            ))}
          </div>

        </article>
      </div>


      <!-- PROYEK 2: LMS SMAN 15 PADANG -->
      <div class="bezel-outer project-card reveal-on-scroll opacity-0 translate-y-8">
        <article class="bezel-inner p-6 sm:p-10">
          
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-8 pb-6 border-b border-white/[0.06] light:border-slate-200">
            <div>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5 mb-3">
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-semibold bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-300 light:text-blue-700 border border-blue-500/20">
                  Proyek Resmi Sekolah
                </span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 light:text-slate-600 bg-white/[0.03] light:bg-slate-100 border border-white/[0.06] light:border-slate-200">
                  Kota Padang, Indonesia
                </span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 light:text-slate-600 bg-white/[0.03] light:bg-slate-100 border border-white/[0.06] light:border-slate-200">
                  Maret 2026 - Juli 2026
                </span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white light:text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
                SMA Negeri 15 Padang: Learning Management System (LMS)
              </h3>
            </div>
            
            <div>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 light:text-emerald-700 text-xs font-semibold border border-emerald-500/20 shadow-sm">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
                Sistem Aktif Digunakan
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="text-slate-300 light:text-slate-700 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
            Bekerja sebagai Web Developer bersama satu rekan pengembang dalam pengembangan Learning Management System (LMS) untuk SMA Negeri 15 Padang. Sistem ini sukses diciptakan, di-deploy langsung menggunakan Git ke hosting Rumahweb, dan digunakan aktif oleh guru dan siswa untuk pembelajaran daring serta rekapitulasi penilaian.
          </p>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mb-8">
            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] light:bg-slate-50 border border-white/[0.06] light:border-slate-200">
              <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white light:text-slate-900 mb-2">Kolaborasi Git Terstruktur</h4>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 light:text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                Manajemen kode menggunakan Git version control dengan pembagian modul yang rapi antara fitur manajemen kelas, tugas, dan rekapitulasi nilai siswa.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] light:bg-slate-50 border border-white/[0.06] light:border-slate-200">
              <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white light:text-slate-900 mb-2">Distribusi Materi & Penugasan</h4>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 light:text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                Penyampaian materi ajar digital, pengunggahan tugas siswa dengan validasi format berkas, dan sistem penilaian otomatis untuk memudahkan guru.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] light:bg-slate-50 border border-white/[0.06] light:border-slate-200">
              <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white light:text-slate-900 mb-2">Deployment Hosting Produksi</h4>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 light:text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                Mengonfigurasi dan men-deploy sistem secara langsung ke hosting Rumahweb menggunakan Git, memastikan stabilitas server dan uptime tinggi.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 pt-5 border-t border-white/[0.06] light:border-slate-200">
            <span class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 light:text-slate-600 mr-2">Teknologi Utama:</span>
            {["Laravel", "PHP", "MySQL", "Tailwind CSS", "Git", "Hosting Rumahweb", "Deployment Produksi"].map((tech) => (
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium bg-white/[0.04] light:bg-slate-100 text-slate-300 light:text-slate-700 border border-white/[0.08] light:border-slate-300">
                {tech}
              </span>
            ))}
          </div>

        </article>
      </div>


      <!-- PROYEK 3: LLDIKTI X SILAB (MAGANG) -->
      <div class="bezel-outer project-card reveal-on-scroll opacity-0 translate-y-8">
        <article class="bezel-inner p-6 sm:p-10">
          
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-8 pb-6 border-b border-white/[0.06] light:border-slate-200">
            <div>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5 mb-3">
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-semibold bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-300 light:text-purple-700 border border-purple-500/20">
                  Pengalaman Magang (Internship)
                </span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 light:text-slate-600 bg-white/[0.03] light:bg-slate-100 border border-white/[0.06] light:border-slate-200">
                  Kota Padang, Indonesia
                </span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 light:text-slate-600 bg-white/[0.03] light:bg-slate-100 border border-white/[0.06] light:border-slate-200">
                  Juni 2025 - Oktober 2025
                </span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white light:text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
                Pengalaman Magang: SiLAB LLDIKTI Wilayah X (Sistem Pembookingan Laboratorium)
              </h3>
            </div>
            
            <div>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-semibold border border-emerald-500/20 shadow-sm">
                <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
                  <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-emerald-400"></span>
                </span>
                Selesai & Terverifikasi
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="text-slate-300 light:text-slate-700 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
            Selama magang di Kantor LLDIKTI Wilayah X, bertugas memelihara, memperbaiki, dan mengembangkan Sistem Informasi Pembookingan Pemakaian Laboratorium (SiLAB). Menyempurnakan pendaftaran pengguna, validasi berkas persyaratan, serta alur verifikasi pemesanan oleh admin.
          </p>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 mb-8">
            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] light:bg-slate-50 border border-white/[0.06] light:border-slate-200">
              <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white light:text-slate-900 mb-2">Pencegahan Bentrokan Jadwal</h4>
